* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* HRDEFPRF
* HELP ROUTINE FOR DEFAULT PROFILE IN MASS ADDITION OF NATSEC
* USERS
* SU1     2013-01-31 unused      Deactivate unused data areas
*
DEFINE DATA
**GLOBAL USING NRM-GL /*SU1 out
PARAMETER
1 CV-DEFPRF(L)
1 #DEFPRF(A8)
*
END-DEFINE
SET KEY PF3
INPUT USING MAP 'HDEFPRF&'
IF *PF-KEY = 'PF3' ESCAPE ROUTINE END-IF
*
CALLNAT 'RSELUS-N' #DEFPRF
MOVE TRUE TO CV-DEFPRF
END
